<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Placer Pacific recommends Placer bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Placer Pacific recommends Placer bid.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The directors of Placer Pacific Ltd on Friday recommended shareholders accept a takeover offer by 75 percent parent Placer Dome Inc of Canada, valued at between A$1.80 and A$1.85 a share.</p>
</text>
